          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 7-day trial is free and has everything unlocked. After 7 days Bombocut stops working unless you buy it once for %@. Nothing renews and nothing is charged automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zkušební verze na 7 dní je zdarma a má odemčené všechno. Po 7 dnech Bombocut přestane fungovat, pokud si ho jednou nekoupíš za %@. Nic se neobnovuje a nic se neplatí automaticky."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The purchase is waiting for approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nákup čeká na schválení."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model is about 650 MB. Wi-Fi is better.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hlasový model má asi 650 MB. Radši přes Wi-Fi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then buy it once, or don't. Simple as that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pak si ho buď jednou koupíš, nebo ne. Tak jednoduché to je."
